## Windows



### Useful JavaScript Installations

Important! Skip these installations if you are not running JavaScript.

#### Node.js/npm or node manager/nvm

Install here: [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download)

Or via winget:

```sh
winget install OpenJS.NodeJS.LTS
```

Verify your installation with these two commands:

```sh
node -v
npm -v
```

Note: the Mac `nvm` tool is **not** cross-compatible with Windows. Windows users should use **nvm-windows** instead, a separate project with the same purpose.

Install here: [nvm-windows](https://github.com/coreybutler/nvm-windows#installation--upgrades)

Run the installer, then restart your terminal.

Install the latest LTS version:

```sh
nvm install lts
nvm use lts
```

Verify your installation:

```sh
nvm ls
```

#### Yarn (optional)

```sh
npm install --global yarn
```

Check your installation:

```sh
yarn --version
```

#### Node version manager for Windows / nvm-windows (optional)

Note: the Mac `nvm` tool is **not** cross-compatible with Windows. Windows users should use **nvm-windows** instead, a separate project with the same purpose.

Install here: [nvm-windows](https://github.com/coreybutler/nvm-windows#installation--upgrades)

Run the installer, then restart your terminal.

Install the latest LTS version:

```sh
nvm install lts
nvm use lts
```

Verify your installation:

```sh
nvm ls
```

